# Gaps between actual code and the approved product

The current system has substantial evidence, authority and recovery foundations. The principal missing work is a complete product interface and continuous operation over those owners, plus specific acquisition and monitoring capabilities. A rewrite is unsupported by the inspected code. Every requirement has an explicit path in [traceability](traceability.md), including all 99 upstream IDs and R2-CHAT, R2-STREAM and R2-GRAPH. The round-1 review added the test-baseline, composition, client, retrieval, interpretation and monitoring-depth rows below.

The approved input is r2 manifest SHA-256 `1c1875228eab75585e865b10f3d68003bc09b251d5ca72754a63beb0774d24b5`, accepted with the actual response "I love it" in [the review record](../.scratch/product-design-2026-11/ui-review-status.md#actual-r2-approval). Frozen reports still contain historical pending-review language. That language does not reopen the satisfied start gate. Browser access was declined and remains declined. This planning work uses source inspection only.

